Z||000000||Heisenhund||01-08-2001||04:50 AM|||| Hi all,<BR> <BR>Did ya ever wonder exactly how to get a 2.8 back into a Fiero? Oh sure, you've looked at the web pages, read all the info, talked with folks who have done it...but you still feel like there might be something you're missing? Well it just so happens I'm to the point of re-installing my engine this weekend and I'm <BR>inviting any interested people to stop by & take a look at the ordeal....errr, procedure. Actually I do have an ulterior motive for this. I'm going to need some help with lifting the car & sliding the pallet the cradle is sitting on under the car. I hope to get a couple of people to help out with that.<P>If you live in the Goose Creek, South Carolina area and are interested, contact me off list for times, dates and directions.<BR> <BR>Heis<P>heisenhund@ureach.com<BR>||||reg||1
